 * The lines one side puts in place of the base lines `[start, end)`, given the
 * changes of that side the region gathered. Its replacement runs from the
 * smallest start of those changes, moved back by however far the region begins
 * before them, to their largest end, moved forward by however far the region
 * ends after them.
